{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgksstMeJ8pmnwA7wuz4v","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with כלל. Pretty sure: it's 0.48%, the cheapest one on the list, and it's a name I know.\n\n**How it went**\n- The top of the page already had \"קרן השתלמות 154\" and \"עוקב מדד S&P 500 12\" picked. That's exactly what I wanted, so I didn't have to touch anything.\n- I read one line: \"12 מסלולים של 12 חברות... דמי ניהול מהחיסכון: מ־0.48% עד 0.7%\". So the cheapest one is 0.48%. I just had to find who.\n- I started at the top of the list. מור is 0.7%, so the top is the expensive end. The line under it says \"מהיקר לזול\", so I thumbed down to the bottom.\n- At the bottom, כלל shows \"0.48% מהחיסכון\". מנורה מבטחים is right above it at 0.49%. Basically the same, but כלל is lower.\n- The last row is אילון קופות גמל with \"עוד לא דווח\". There's a warning icon and a \"חדש\" tag, a name I don't know, and 40% stocks. Skipped it.\n- I glanced at the 3-year returns. מיטב shows 13.85%, which pulled at me a bit. כלל's 13.37% is fine though.\n\n**What I skipped:** the \"לפי חברה\" tab, the \"מה זה קרן השתלמות\" link, the search box, the stocks/foreign currency circles, the small text at the bottom and the footer.\n\n**Where I hesitated or wasn't sure**\n- The column \"דמי ניהול ממוצע 2025 מהחיסכון\" and under it \"אין מההפקדות\". Does \"אין\" mean there's no deposit fee? I think so. Not totally sure.\n- The 101% stocks at אנליסט. How is it more than 100%?\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" in the return column. I guess those are too new to have a number.\n- מנורה's row is split between the two screens. Its 0.49% was on the first screen, but I had to scroll to see the rest.\n\n**What bothered me**\n- The list starts with the most expensive. I was looking for the cheapest, so I had to scroll all the way down to get my answer.\n- The fees are all percents and they all look tiny. Nothing tells me what that means in shekels.\n- It doesn't say what the first step is: how I actually open it at כלל or move my fund there."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1393,"cache_read_input_tokens":7807,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1393},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8bf975a3-9e05-42b9-b407-8b3369ca23c3","uuid":"bae2439c-b293-4095-bd41-af65bb908924","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:22:50.748Z","request_id":"req_011Cgksst7296hat5NDmPncY"}
